# ⚠ THE SHOW HAS MOVED PAST THIS FILE. content/media_broadcasts/bc_the_quiet_hour.json is the
# source: its graph was edited in VINE (openings by the hour, the viewer checks, the real-news
# eleven, the asides), and it has three voices now (THE HORIZONTAL, npc_ingrid_sterne, and THE
# VERTICAL, npc_lorne_prentiss) and tonight's story. Recompiling this file would throw all of
# that away. Edit the graph.
@broadcast "The Quiet Hour"
@category overnight
@length 300
@type scripted
@acted
@host npc_leland_vey

::actors
@actor npc_leland_vey
@alias npc_leland_vey CONTROL
@billing npc_leland_vey THE CONTROL VOICE
::endactors

::scene SIGN_ON

EVENT FADE_IN

TITLE quiet_hour_testcard

SHOT
The test card rolls, slips sideways, and comes back. A sine wave crosses the screen, flattens into one bright line, and holds.
SHOT_END

CONTROL:
Your set's fine. Leave it alone. We've got the picture now.

WAIT 2

CONTROL:
We can make it roll. We can make it so bright you look away, or so dim you lean in. We can make that line do anything we like.

CONTROL:
For the next hour we decide what you see and what you hear. Sit back. We'll tell you when it's yours again.

WAIT 3

♪ A single sustained tone, low and warm, the kind you stop hearing after a while and then notice you have stopped hearing. ♪

WAIT 4

CONTROL:
It is two o'clock in the morning in Coldwater Basin.

WAIT 2

CONTROL:
There is nothing on. That is what this is for.

::scene THE_BREATHING

TITLE quiet_hour_testcard

SHOT
The test card holds. In the lower right corner, a small counter increments by one, then by three, then settles.
SHOT_END

CONTROL:
If you are awake because you are working, we hope the shift is a short one.

CONTROL:
If you are awake because you cannot sleep, try this with us.

WAIT 2

CONTROL:
Breathe in for four.

WAIT 4

CONTROL:
Hold for four.

WAIT 4

CONTROL:
Out for six.

WAIT 6

CONTROL:
Better. Your heart rate came down two points.

WAIT 3

CONTROL:
We can see that from here.

::scene THE_COUNT

TITLE quiet_hour_count

SHOT
The number on screen ticks downward as the hour goes on. It does not tick up.
SHOT_END

CONTROL:
{viewers} people are awake and watching this with you.

WAIT 2

CONTROL:
Four hundred of them are in the vats and do not know they are watching.

WAIT 2

CONTROL:
Eleven of them will not be watching by four o'clock. We are not going to tell you which eleven. That would spoil the hour.

WAIT 3

CONTROL:
You are not one of the eleven. You can relax.

WAIT 2

CONTROL:
We checked.

::scene INTERFERENCE

TECH_DIFFICULTIES 8

SHOT
The signal drops. Static, seven seconds of it, and underneath the static something that is almost the tone from earlier, slowed down.
SHOT_END

TITLE quiet_hour_testcard

CONTROL:
Apologies. That was not us.

WAIT 2

CONTROL:
Where were we.

::scene THE_QUESTION

CONTROL:
Some of you write in and ask who makes this programme.

WAIT 2

CONTROL:
It is made for you. It is made every night. It has been made every night for a very long time, and it will be made tomorrow, whether or not you are here to receive it.

WAIT 3

CONTROL:
That is not a threat. It is a schedule.

::scene SIGN_OFF

TITLE quiet_hour_testcard

CONTROL:
The Quiet Hour will continue until the morning service begins at four.

CONTROL:
Until then: stay in. Stay warm. Stay still.

WAIT 2

CONTROL:
We like it when you are still.

TICKER
THE QUIET HOUR · Overnight service · This broadcast contains no advertising and requires no subscription · Viewing figures are collected passively and are not stored, except where they are · Persons experiencing distress should remain seated until it passes · The morning service begins at 04:00 · Thank you for watching · Thank you for watching · Thank you for watching
TICKER_END

CONTROL:
That's the hour. We give you back your set.

CONTROL:
Same time tomorrow. You'll know it's us when the picture starts to roll.

♪ The tone resumes. It does not resolve. It simply continues, at exactly the volume it was before. ♪

CREDITS 8
THE QUIET HOUR
Presented by THE CONTROL VOICE.
Broadcast nightly since before the record begins.
END_CREDITS

END
